# Buurtstallingen broncode

The buurtstallingen Java slot-engine source lives in the **`buurtstallingen-broncode`** folder at the project root:

- **Path (this PC):** `buurtstallingen-broncode/` (relative to this workspace)
- **Full path:** `<workspace>/buurtstallingen-broncode`
- **Note:** This folder is local-only: it is in `.gitignore` and not in version control. When present, use it for parity checks and to see which `/v1` bikepark methods CF/FMS call. It is **not** an FMS v2/v3 client. If not present and the user asks Java-backend-specific questions, report that the source is not available.
